{"id":"ccbc15:problem:4-34","answer":"LOGARITHM","hints":[{"number":1,"title":"我毫无头绪","html":"<p>本题为经典海盗分金博弈的变种，下方的曲线是海盗船的航线，可以判断每条航线海盗船经历了哪些漩涡，在海盗分金过程中加入漩涡对应的额外条件。</p>","text":"本题为经典海盗分金博弈的变种，下方的曲线是海盗船的航线，可以判断每条航线海盗船经历了哪些漩涡，在海盗分金过程中加入漩涡对应的额外条件。","assetIds":[]},{"number":2,"title":"该如何提取","html":"<p>根据上一步的结果，分到金的海盗视为1，未分到的视为0，求二进制值并转字母。</p>","text":"根据上一步的结果，分到金的海盗视为1，未分到的视为0，求二进制值并转字母。","assetIds":[]}],"additionalAnswers":[],"solution":{"status":"external_only","format":"text","html":"<p><a href=\"https://docs.qq.com/sheet/DT3JqY3VMY0ZsbHFD?tab=BB08J2\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">解析链接</a></p>","text":"解析链接","refId":null,"assetIds":[]},"extended":{"html":"<p>你要离开之前，获得了一份旅游指南，你注意到其中一句话被圈了出来：“石油，又称黑金子，是这里主要生产的资源。”</p>","text":"你要离开之前，获得了一份旅游指南，你注意到其中一句话被圈了出来：“石油，又称黑金子，是这里主要生产的资源。”","assetIds":[]},"interactive":{},"sourceMetadata":{"type":"problem","content-type":1,"external_solution_snapshot":{"source_url":"https://docs.qq.com/sheet/DT3JqY3VMY0ZsbHFD?tab=BB08J2","page_raw_path":"data/raw/ccbc15/external_solutions/34-DT3JqY3VMY0ZsbHFD.html","page_bytes":422330,"page_sha256":"5f8b1b5bedf985c00e64b79c014cecb45d49fa31db51fd8dcea0a2f3f2cf5073","data_snapshot":{"source_url":"https://docs.qq.com/dop-api/opendoc?tab=BB08J2&u=&noEscape=1&enableSmartsheetSplit=1&startrow=0&endrow=60&needSheetState=1&sliceStates=1&&block_end_col=31&block_end_row=255&block_start_col=0&block_start_row=0&id=DT3JqY3VMY0ZsbHFD&normal=1&outformat=1&wb=1&nowb=0&callback=clientVarsCallback&xsrf=&t=900b62d9c3454a86a603a94b005fd185","raw_path":"data/raw/ccbc15/external_solutions/34-DT3JqY3VMY0ZsbHFD-opendoc.js","bytes":20207,"sha256":"6e378c359c597073ad9b65d46bc70e98a5c9ca76e48f00f135de79fd20af239d","format":"Tencent Docs opendoc JSONP with compressed sheet protobuf blocks"}}},"failedAssets":[],"assets":[]}
